Package: oissyntheticdata
Type: Package
Title: Aggregate Profiles and Synthetic Files for Confidential Data
Version: 3.0.0
Date: 2026-11-12
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yohanan", "Ouaknine", email = "yohanan.ouaknine@ois.co.il", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("OIS", role = "cph", comment = "https://ois.co.il"))
Description: Profiles a folder of 'Excel' and CSV files into aggregate-only
    'JSON' files (counts, shares and quantiles, with no cell below a minimum
    count), rebuilds synthetic files with the same names, columns,
    distributions and working joins from those 'JSON' files, and gives an
    analysis script a small statistics toolbox. An analysis script can then be
    written on the synthetic files and run unchanged on the confidential files,
    in the place where they are kept. The tool is the single file 'gov_one.R',
    which uses base R only and works offline. The package ships that file
    unchanged and can copy it out, to be carried into a place where no package
    can be installed. The 'JSON' files are interchangeable with those written
    by the 'Python' package of the same name.
